docs/decisions.md:122:These items were undesigned when the chapters were cleaned up on 2026-11-03. **The owner approved their design provisionally on 2026-11-05** ([the decided rows](#decided-2026-11-05-core): allocator identities Q1, allocation contracts Q1–Q2, the heap-array view Q3, static text Q4, capability inference Q5, unsafe contracts Q3.7–Q3.12, static refusal Q6, grants Q7, semantic objects Q8–Q9). Where a chapter still says **undecided: see the target Core proposal**, read the decided row; the rule is rewritten in Lean at stage A2b and frozen at A2c. The proposal is owned by
